mixin MessageCard(item)
    div(class='bg-base4 p-2.5 md:p-4 rounded-sm')
      
        a(href="view_video.html") 
            h6(class='text-primary mb-2 hover:underline') 初體驗從喪失處男的那天開始單獨2人專心SEX直到天亮的脫處DREAM同居記錄 三上悠亞
            div(class='flex pb-3 dx-hairline--bottom')
                div(class='w-[140px] md:w-[214px]')
                    div(class='aspect-w-6 aspect-h-5')
                        img(data-src=item.poster, src='/static/frontend/images/loading.svg' alt=item.title title=item.title)
                div(class='flex flex-col ml-3 md:ml-5 py-0.5 justify-between  opacity-60')
                    div(class='flex items-center')
                        svg(class='w-4 h-4 mr-1')
                            use(href='/static/frontend/icons/icons.svg#author')
                        | 作者最多5个
                    div(class='flex items-center')
                        svg(class='w-4 h-4 mr-1')
                            use(href='/static/frontend/icons/icons.svg#time')
                        | 7个月前
                    div(class='flex items-center')
                        svg(class='w-4 h-4 mr-1')
                            use(href='/static/frontend/icons/icons.svg#comment')
                        | 129
                    div(class='flex items-center')
                        svg(class='w-4 h-4 mr-1')
                            use(href='/static/frontend/icons/icons.svg#view')
                        | 2223

            div(class='mt-3  line-clamp-3 opacity-60') 留言： 初體驗從喪失處男的那天開始單獨2人專心SEX直到天亮的脫處DREAM同居記錄初體驗從喪失處男的那天開始單獨2人專心SEX直到天亮的脫處DREAM同居記錄